context-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c31142fca5bb561bEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-daff5c21fa7af1b6END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UND_Grymforge_GrymforgeHistory</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UND_Grymforge_GrymforgeHistory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UND_Grymforge_GrymforgeHistory\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">cf0956a7-5aa2-4f48-b005-ff5724eaf8c6</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cf0956a7-5aa2-4f48-b005-ff5724eaf8c6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cf0956a7-5aa2-4f48-b005-ff5724eaf8c6\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a bookshelf next to a <a href=\"/wiki/Mithral\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a> vein in the <a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Refuge\" title=\"Abandoned Refuge\">Abandoned Refuge</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-560&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;282</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The binding of this book is thicker than its combined pages, which are surprisingly devoid of detail.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>We know little of the ones that came before, but we know they worshipped the <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Lady of Loss</a>. We know they constructed the great fortress, and named... [The next few words are smeared and illegible.] But from whence they came, and why they departed - this is a mystery\neven to Ketheric Thorm himself.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>What we do know is that Shar's Chosen has heard Her call. Just as Grymforge served our Mistress eight hundred years nigh, so it would again.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Here, Thorm's <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar\" title=\"Dark Justiciar\">Dark Justiciars</a> shall rise.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Here, we will fulfil our Goddess’ pact.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Here, we will rebuild the lost city of Grymforge.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>So far will our shadows spread, and so dark will they be, that <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne's</a> light may be forever extinguished.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Justiciars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dark Justiciars\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Justiciars\">Dark Justiciars</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mithral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mithral\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/